### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5112
@authToken = 

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser2",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login with the registered user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

